          "text": "Suricata is a network IDS, IPS and NSM engine. From version 8.0.0 to before version 8.0.4, use of the \"tls.alpn\" rule keyword can cause Suricata to crash with a NULL dereference. This issue has been patched in version 8.0.4.",
